# Data files are checksummed byte-for-byte by ph_economic_ai/benchmark/provenance.py.
# Without this, core.autocrlf differences between platforms silently change what a
# checkout produces, so the same commit hashes differently on Windows and Linux CI --
# the file's actual content never changed, but the platform doing the checkout did.
*.csv text eol=lf
*.provenance.json text eol=lf
